OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely dry
OL,6,Fwith clear spells this evening and
OL,7,Finto tonight, but cloudier in the far
OL,8,Fnorth with the odd spot of rain. Areas
OL,9,Fof mist and fog could develop under
OL,10,Fclear skies, mainly in the south.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA foggy start on Tuesday,
OL,13,Flifting through the morning. It will
OL,14,Fstay rather mixed with bright or sunny
OL,15,Fintervals, and spots of rain mainly in
OL,16,Fthe north. Still feeling mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
