OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FAn
OL,6,Funsettled start to Wednesday but rain
OL,7,Fgradually clears for sunny spells and
OL,8,Fa fresher, more autumnal feel. Long
OL,9,Fsunny spells through Thursday but
OL,10,Ffeeling cooler. Turning unsettled into
OL,11,FFriday.
